v0.4.4
  * Don't snap scroll to feed-item boundaries.
  * Added option to customize feed title.

v0.4.3
  * Fixed text colour in config dialog.
  * Minor spelling changes for consistency.

v0.4.2
  * Fixed an issue with background colour on Plasma 6.6.2.

v0.4.1
  * Added option to use a non-animated loading indicator, to reduce power usage
    on battery-powered systems.

v0.4
  * Ported Andreas Loos's version to Plasma 6.
  * Incorporated some improvements from Mircea Kitsune.
  * Fixed wrapping of titles.
  * Improved theme support.
  * Enriched the context menu.
